FIXME Adapt the environment names and resource tasks to the product.
Prepare an authorized endpoint and a JSON credentials file containing `key`
and `secret`. The scenario owns only records prefixed `molecule_fixture_`.

```sh
export MOLECULE_PRODUCT_URL=https://lab.example.invalid/api
export MOLECULE_PRODUCT_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/credentials.json
uv run noxfile.py -s molecule
```

Use a run-owned `ANSIBLE_HOME`, `XDG_CACHE_HOME` and collection path. The
scenario runs locally against the supplied endpoint; it performs no host
preparation. It verifies saved and active state, checks a changed value and
removes its records. The shared provisioning playbooks remain available for
a lab that owns its target; see the alternative in `default/molecule.yml`.
